{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id255253855"}, "name":{"label":"Sodamnlividrn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-14T07:08:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.8.0"}, "id":{"label":"14426895543"}, "title":{"label":"Bad customer service for 10 year customer"}, "content":{"label":"I paid for the app, the app bundle even, at the time of purchase (as were all apps at the time) purchasing the app included all future features. Now they turned to subscription base model i have to pay more money? Fat chance. I paid for all these already. You cant just decide 10 years later you want to retroactively charge people more. Alot of these apps are now doing this, taking away feature that were originally paid for, claiming they’re new and making you pay for what you already had access to. Just last year i was able to customize the app and now thats a premium feature? Gfy 😂 ill keep the app downloaded CAUSE I PAID FOR IT, but will forever use the free weather sites. Good job at losing your longtime customers, warning to new ones: itll be you eventually. Also $30 for things you can get for free online? Get bent!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
