{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id120032673"}, "name":{"label":"VRobidas"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-18T21:40:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"14320949799"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent for Weather Apple Watch Face"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had the pleasure to use this APP with a Premium Membership! I love it! It allows me to choose which weather information I have available on my Apple Watch! It allows me to make my own forecasts! Trend is the key!\n\nAnother great feature, it allows me to incorporate my own WeatherFlow Station on my watch! Temperature just outside my door is far more reliable! Can you tell I love this APP! Had it fer several years now!\n\nHaving said that, most recently my Apple Watch has been vocal about the weather unsolicited! Both with Series 6 current update and now Series 8 with current update! I just move my wrist slightly and it intermittently talks about coming rain! Usually 4 words then it stops!  I’d say 9 - 12 times a day! Including in bed and while it is charging! Only last two months!\n\nOtherwise, the perfect App for me!\n\nVictor, North Bay, ON, CAN", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
