{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id118321713"}, "name":{"label":"Licorne impolie"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-14T06:33:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13632611262"}, "title":{"label":"Funny, cute"}, "content":{"label":"L’appli n’est pas dispo en français mais bon. C’est pas vraiment une appli météo, il faut choisir la source comme Accuweather ou Environnement Canada, donc l’appli ne fait que relayer l’info venue d’ailleurs. La fiabilité de Carrot dépend donc de votre choix. It’s US made and US centric. I’m in Canada and I get the « new » from the US. Nothing actually local even if that’s what I picked in the settings. It’s a cute app with a dark humour that I really appreciate but not enough to pay over 50$/year for a subscription, I’ll keep my boring but free weather apps. Sorry.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
