{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id152526998"}, "name":{"label":"Steveleamont"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-30T05:51:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"13333502654"}, "title":{"label":"Sad"}, "content":{"label":"This app used to be so accurate! I have been using it for years. Just can’t rely on it anymore. For example last night at 9:00 pm  I checked to see if it was going to rain the next morning. It showed 0 chance. I woke up at 8:00 am to rain. This app used to be exact! The best. Not anymore. Cancelling my subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id87387575"}, "name":{"label":"Xtropy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-12T11:01:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"13258013685"}, "title":{"label":"CarPlay sucks, don’t upgrade"}, "content":{"label":"Don’t upgrade to Ultra to get CarPlay. You get a screenshot of a radar for the CarPlay component and the dev wants $40 for it (twice the price of Premium+). I upgraded from Premium+ which I’ve had for 5 years and to get back what I had, I now need to pay 40% more for Premium+ since the dev now charges more that sub level. Contacted the dev and told there is nothing they can do. Maybe showing what you get with CarPlay on your website would help instead of making people pay to find out? Terrible sales tactic and manipulated as a loyal longterm customer. Don’t support this dev.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
